The STL meshes in this directory (baza, 1brat, 2brat, 3brat, 4brat, flansa,
efector) come from https://github.com/TheMalaland/_Mitsubishi_Melfa_RV_2AJ
(exported from its robot_nou.SLDASM SolidWorks model), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). They are an approximate community model,
not Mitsubishi CAD. Fitting the joint hubs shows the parts are true scale and
match the official link lengths (BFP-A8050) to about 2 mm, so the URDF uses
them unscaled.
